{
  "chapterId": 92,
  "translation": {
    "source": "QuranEnc.com",
    "sourceUrl": "https://quranenc.com/en/home/api",
    "title": "English Translation - Noor International Center",
    "version": "1.1.2"
  },
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "arabicText": " وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰ",
      "englishText": "By the night when it covers[1937]",
      "footnotes": "[1937] With darkness.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092001.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "arabicText": "وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "And [by] the day when it appears",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092002.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "arabicText": "وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلْأُنثَىٰٓ",
      "englishText": "And [by] He who created the male and female,",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092003.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّ سَعْيَكُمْ لَشَتَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, your efforts are diverse.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092004.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "arabicText": "فَأَمَّا مَنْ أَعْطَىٰ وَٱتَّقَىٰ",
      "englishText": "As for he who gives and fears Allāh",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "arabicText": "وَصَدَّقَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And believes in the best [reward].",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "arabicText": "فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ",
      "englishText": "We will ease him toward ease.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092007.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "arabicText": "وَأَمَّا مَنۢ بَخِلَ وَٱسْتَغْنَىٰ",
      "englishText": "But as for he who withholds and considers himself free of need",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092008.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "arabicText": "وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلْحُسْنَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And denies the best [reward],",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092009.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "arabicText": "فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلْعُسْرَىٰ",
      "englishText": "We will ease him toward difficulty.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "arabicText": "وَمَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُ مَالُهُۥٓ إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ",
      "englishText": "And what will his wealth avail him when he falls?[1938]",
      "footnotes": "[1938] i.e., when he dies or is destroyed. It can also mean when he falls into the Hellfire.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "arabicText": "إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا لَلْهُدَىٰ",
      "englishText": "Indeed, [incumbent] upon Us is guidance.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "arabicText": "وَإِنَّ لَنَا لَلْـَٔاخِرَةَ وَٱلْأُولَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And indeed, to us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life].",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "arabicText": "فَأَنذَرْتُكُمْ نَارًا تَلَظَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "So I have warned you of a Fire which is blazing.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "arabicText": "لَا يَصْلَىٰهَآ إِلَّا ٱلْأَشْقَى",
      "englishText": "None will [enter to] burn therein except the most wretched one",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "arabicText": "ٱلَّذِى كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "Who had denied and turned away.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "arabicText": "وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا ٱلْأَتْقَى",
      "englishText": "But the righteous one will avoid it –",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "arabicText": "ٱلَّذِى يُؤْتِى مَالَهُۥ يَتَزَكَّىٰ",
      "englishText": "[He] who gives [from] his wealth to purify himself",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "arabicText": "وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِندَهُۥ مِن نِّعْمَةٍ تُجْزَىٰٓ",
      "englishText": "And not [giving] for anyone who has [done him] a favor to be rewarded[1939] –",
      "footnotes": "[1939] i.e., without intending reciprocation for some benefit to himself.",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "arabicText": "إِلَّا ٱبْتِغَآءَ وَجْهِ رَبِّهِ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ",
      "englishText": "But only seeking the face [i.e., acceptance] of his Lord, Most High.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "arabicText": "وَلَسَوْفَ يَرْضَىٰ",
      "englishText": "And he is going to be satisfied.",
      "footnotes": "",
      "audioUrl": "Alafasy/mp3/092021.mp3"
    }
  ]
}
